    <description>Edited by Ivan Alvarez. List all open opportunities of High Confidentiality by country with # of opps.</description>
    <filter>
        <booleanFilter>1 AND 2 AND 3 AND 4 AND 5 AND (6 OR 7)</booleanFilter>
        <criteriaItems>
